# Architecture review (SA, condensed)

Not SE PR review, not QC gate, not SRE/SecOps. Diff C4 vs code, check fitness functions, ADR gaps. Escalate; user decides.

When: hard-to-undo change, stale C4, fitness theater, missing ADR. One sitting.

Loop: intent → C4 L1–L3 vs deployables/packages → fitness (exist, failed recently, blocks merge) → ADR vs code → verdict + owner.

C4 fail: diagram container with no shippable; repo store/queue/service omitted; domain imports infra with no contract.
Fitness fail: slogan-only characteristic; checks never fail; warning-only.
ADR: missing for >6 month choice; code vs accepted ADR. Do not relitigate. Why-the-product → `why-strategic-rationale`.

Escalate: implementation/tests → SE (`code-review-pr`); runtime/SLO → SRE; threat/secrets → SecOps; gates → QC.

Output: Scope / Intent / C4 / Fitness / ADRs / Escalate / User decides.

Pointers: `c4-model`, `evolutionary-architecture`, `architecture-decision-records`, `clean-architecture`, `ddd-core`.
